Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------------

This repository was forked from ha-garmin-fitness-coach-addon at upstream
commit 0091b9356 on 2026-08-13, and files carried over from the upstream
projects have been modified since. The add-on was renamed to Pacer, the
application source was vendored into pacer/app/ and is built from there,
and the coaching engine, the web interface and the add-on's boot path have
all been changed.

The changes are listed in pacer/CHANGELOG.md. Per-file authorship remains
visible in the Git history.


